PRODUCT DESCRIPTIONS
Tru PU Pura 1K is a single-component, ready-to-use, pure polyurethane-based, liquid applied waterprooﬁng membrane. It
has excellent waterprooﬁng properties and can be applied by brush & roller. It is ideal for waterprooﬁng of terrace, roofs,
balconies, bridges, podium and canals, etc.
